♪ Baking it ♪

00:05:40.399 --> 00:05:42.228
♪ A baking show with hosts you know ♪

00:05:42.228 --> 00:05:44.239
♪ Grannies judge and give out dough ♪

00:05:44.239 --> 00:05:45.560
♪ Baking it ♪

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:46.710
